  "description": "“Bear my husband’s child.” \n\nThe wife of the boss she served asked her to bear her husband’s child. \n\n“Ji Ye-won, you need the money, don’t you?” \n\nYe-won swallowed her bewilderment. Her widowed mother had been diagnosed with an incurable disease. Even if she poured in her entire annual salary, she couldn't afford the treatment costs. Ye-won was being consumed daily by the weight of money. \n\n“I’ll do it. I’ll bear the Executive Director’s child.” \n\nYe-won bowed deeply to Choi Seol-young. In her bag was a thick envelope; Ye-won had just traded her life, her pride, and everything else for that single envelope.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14048887), [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/5285002412), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/metatoon122), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/pregnant_boss), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078517)",
